3
00:00:26,460 --> 00:00:28,390
<i>Ini Asgardian!</i>

4
00:00:28,390 --> 00:00:30,860
<i>Dalam kapal pengungsi negarawan!</i>

5
00:00:33,560 --> 00:00:34,860
<i>Kami sedang diserang!</i>

6
00:00:34,870 --> 00:00:37,260
<i>Ku-ulangi, kami sedang diserang!</i>

7
00:00:37,270 --> 00:00:40,830
<i>Semua mesin mati,
pendukung hidup rusak.</i>

8
00:00:40,840 --> 00:00:44,140
<i>Meminta bantuan dari
seluruh kapal terdekat.</i>

9
00:00:44,140 --> 00:00:48,140
<i>Kami berada di 22 titik lompat
dari Asgard.</i>

10
00:00:48,140 --> 00:00:50,710
<i>Awak dipenuhi keluarga Asgardian!</i>

11
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:52,450
<i>Prajurit hanya ada sedikit!</i>

12
00:00:52,450 --> 00:00:54,420
<i>Ini bukan kapal perang!</i>

13
00:00:54,420 --> 00:00:56,420
<i>Ku-ulangi, ini bukan kapal perang!</i>

14
00:01:09,800 --> 00:01:12,800
Dengarkan aku dan bersuka citalah.

15
00:01:16,640 --> 00:01:18,910
Kalian memiliki hak istimewa...

16
00:01:18,910 --> 00:01:21,640
...karena telah diselamatkan oleh
Titan yang Agung.

17
00:01:24,610 --> 00:01:26,780
Kalian mungkin berpikir,
bahwa ini penderitaan..,

18
00:01:27,950 --> 00:01:29,150
Bukan.

19
00:01:30,190 --> 00:01:32,460
Ini penyelamatan.

20
00:01:36,360 --> 00:01:39,980
Kita menuju keseimbangan
skala universal..,

21
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:41,800
...berkat pengorbanan kalian.

22
00:01:43,500 --> 00:01:44,900
Tersenyumlah.

23
00:01:46,230 --> 00:01:48,370
Meskipun dalam kematian..,

24
00:01:48,370 --> 00:01:50,740
...kalian telah menjadi
anak-anak Thanos.

25
00:02:06,290 --> 00:02:08,320
Aku tahu rasanya kalah.

26
00:02:10,460 --> 00:02:13,430
Merasa sangat putus asa
bahwa kau benar..,

27
00:02:14,080 --> 00:02:16,830
Namun tetap gagal, bagaimana pun juga.

28
00:02:24,910 --> 00:02:26,610
Menakutkan sekali.

29
00:02:27,880 --> 00:02:29,850
Mengubah kaki menjadi jeli.

30
00:02:31,950 --> 00:02:34,250
Namun, kutanya padamu,
untuk apa juga?

31
00:02:35,580 --> 00:02:37,030
Takutilah.

32
00:02:37,030 --> 00:02:38,250
Larilah darinya.

33
00:02:39,290 --> 00:02:41,720
Takdir akan tetap tiba.

34
00:02:42,890 --> 00:02:44,760
Dan sekarang, takdir itu di sini.

35
00:02:45,430 --> 00:02:47,300
Atau haruskah kubilang..,

36
00:02:48,560 --> 00:02:50,200
Aku disini.

37
00:02:55,500 --> 00:02:56,810
Kau terlalu banyak bicara.

38
00:02:58,040 --> 00:02:59,910
Tesseract-nya.

39
00:02:59,910 --> 00:03:02,210
Atau kepala Saudara-mu.

40
00:03:06,750 --> 00:03:09,250
Kau pasti punya pilihan sendiri.

41
00:03:10,450 --> 00:03:11,750
Aku punya.

42
00:03:14,020 --> 00:03:15,220
Bunuh saja!

43
00:03:30,470 --> 00:03:31,540
Baiklah, hentikan!

44
00:03:35,010 --> 00:03:37,310
Kami tidak punya Tesseract-nya.

45
00:03:37,310 --> 00:03:38,950
Sudah hancur di Asgard.

46
00:03:49,820 --> 00:03:52,690
Kau sungguh saudara terburuk.

47
00:03:57,770 --> 00:03:59,800
Kupastikan, saudara-ku.

48
00:03:59,800 --> 00:04:01,870
Matahari akan menyinari kita lagi.

49
00:04:03,740 --> 00:04:07,010
Kau salah sudah merasa optimis, Asgardian.

50
00:04:07,010 --> 00:04:09,120
Ada satu hal..,

51
00:04:09,120 --> 00:04:11,110
Aku bukan Asgardian.

52
00:04:11,110 --> 00:04:12,310
Dan satu hal lagi..,

53
00:04:14,680 --> 00:04:15,920
Kami punya Hulk.

54
00:04:28,060 --> 00:04:29,860
Biarkan dia bersenang-senang.

55
00:05:22,150 --> 00:05:23,720
<i>Allfathers...</i>

56
00:05:25,380 --> 00:05:29,180
...izinkan sihir hitam mengalir
dalam diriku untuk terakhir...

57
00:05:29,180 --> 00:05:30,660
...kalinya.

58
00:05:45,610 --> 00:05:47,010
Ini sebuah kesalahan.

59
00:05:52,620 --> 00:05:54,560
Tidak!

60
00:06:03,760 --> 00:06:06,320
Kau akan mati karena perbuatanmu!

61
00:06:17,670 --> 00:06:19,470
Orang terkemuka-ku yang
rendah hati..,

62
00:06:20,810 --> 00:06:23,040
...berlututlah dihadapan
keagungan kalian.

63
00:06:26,120 --> 00:06:29,540
Tiada makhluk yang pernah
memiliki kekuatan..,

64
00:06:29,980 --> 00:06:32,020
Kaum bangsawan..,

65
00:06:32,020 --> 00:06:36,790
...untuk menggunakan
dua Batu Keabadian.

66
00:06:40,160 --> 00:06:44,700
Alam semesta berada
dibawah genggaman-mu.

67
00:07:23,760 --> 00:07:26,710
Ada 2 batu lagi di Bumi.

68
00:07:28,070 --> 00:07:29,530
Temukan, anak-anakku.

69
00:07:29,530 --> 00:07:31,910
Dan bawakan padaku di Titan.

70
00:07:31,910 --> 00:07:33,580
Ayah, kami tak akan mengecewakanmu..,

71
00:07:33,580 --> 00:07:36,110
Jika aku boleh menyela..,

72
00:07:36,120 --> 00:07:40,290
Jika kalian pergi ke Bumi,
kalian mungkin butuh pemandu.

73
00:07:40,290 --> 00:07:42,980
Aku punya pengalaman
berada di sana.

74
00:07:42,980 --> 00:07:45,440
Jika maksudmu, pengalaman gagal..,

75
00:07:45,620 --> 00:07:48,230
Maksudku pengalaman sebenarnya.

76
00:07:49,600 --> 00:07:51,230
Thanos yang Mahakuasa.

77
00:07:51,230 --> 00:07:54,310
Aku Loki.

78
00:07:54,310 --> 00:07:55,920
Pangeran Asgard.

79
00:07:59,760 --> 00:08:01,040
Odinson.

80
00:08:04,800 --> 00:08:06,850
Raja sah dari Jotunheim.

81
00:08:07,350 --> 00:08:09,250
Dewa Kenakalan.

82
00:08:10,080 --> 00:08:12,380
Dengan ini, kuserahkan padamu..,

83
00:08:13,090 --> 00:08:16,990
Kesetiaan kekal saya.

84
00:08:27,630 --> 00:08:28,980
"Kekal?"

85
00:08:32,870 --> 00:08:36,040
Pilih kata-katamu lebih hati-hati lagi.

86
00:08:56,940 --> 00:08:58,030
Kau..,

87
00:08:59,130 --> 00:09:00,800
...tak akan pernah..,

88
00:09:03,120 --> 00:09:04,500
...menjadi Dewa.

89
00:09:14,910 --> 00:09:15,910
Tidak!

90
00:09:30,900 --> 00:09:33,300
Tidak ada kebangkitan lagi kali ini.

91
00:09:56,990 --> 00:09:59,120
Tidak. Loki.

92
00:10:37,960 --> 00:10:40,900
<i>Serius?
Kau tidak punya uang sama sekali?</i>

93
00:10:41,030 --> 00:10:44,200
Ikatan pada materi
dapat merusak spiritual.

94
00:10:44,200 --> 00:10:45,600
Akan kuberitahu orangnya
saat di Deli.

95
00:10:45,600 --> 00:10:47,800
Mungkin mereka akan buatkan daging
metafisik dengan gandum hitam.

96
00:10:47,810 --> 00:10:49,720
Tunggu, tunggu.
Kurasa aku punya 200.

97
00:10:49,720 --> 00:10:50,860
Dollar?

98
00:10:50,880 --> 00:10:52,380
Rupee./
Yang berarti?

99
00:10:52,680 --> 00:10:54,300
Setengah Dollar.

100
00:10:54,300 --> 00:10:55,860
Apa yang kau mau?

101
00:10:56,210 --> 00:10:58,350
Aku tidak mau Daging Tuna.

102
00:11:10,930 --> 00:11:12,900
Thanos akan datang.

103
00:11:13,260 --> 00:11:14,580
Dia akan datang.

104
00:11:18,870 --> 00:11:20,050
Siapa?

105
00:11:20,180 --> 00:11:28,720
<b><font color="#ff8000"><font color="#ff8000"><font face="Century Gothic"><font color="#ffff00">GradyNanoNano</font></font></font></b>
